OL,3,GNEWSAGas company expected safety to be
OL,4,A'paramount'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas explosion that killed 10 people
OL,7,Fhappened because gas workers ignored
OL,8,Fthe company's procedures, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FThe fatal blast happened at Haut du
OL,12,FMont flats in Jersey in the early hours
OL,13,Fof 10 December 2022. Gas workers Neil
OL,14,FArmstrong, John Wright and Lee Ward all
OL,15,Fdeny 10 counts of gross negligence
OL,16,Fmanslaughter, while Island Energy has
OL,17,Fpleaded not guilty to two health and
OL,18,Fsafety breaches.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
