OL,3,GNEWSAGas company expected safety to be
OL,4,A'paramount'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdvocate Mike Preston, defence for
OL,7,FIsland Energy, told Jersey's Royal
OL,8,FCourt the explosion happened "because
OL,9,Fpeople who knew exactly what they were
OL,10,Frequired to do chose not to do it".
OL,12,FHe told jurors the company "expected
OL,13,Fhealth and safety to be respected and
OL,14,Fparamount".
